CharacterName,Juggernaut,主宰
CharacterName,Morphling,变体精灵
ClassDescription,"A fluid DOTA2 hero who commands surging waves, shifts freely between Strength and Agility, empowers himself through Ebb & Flow, and morphs into foes.",来自 DOTA2 的水元素英雄：能化作波浪突进、自由转换力量与敏捷、凭先天技能「潮涨潮落」随属性动态强化移速/射程/施法距离/减速抗性，并可变形为敌人形态。
ClassDescription,"A masked DOTA2 blademaster who builds unstoppable momentum through Bladeform, carves through magic with Blade Fury, sustains allies with Healing Ward, and cuts down foes with Blade Dance and Omnislash.",来自 DOTA2 的面具剑客：凭先天技能「剑心犹在」积攒无伤势能强化移速与敏捷、以「剑刃风暴」破法清场、以「治疗守卫」续航，并以「剑舞」暴击与「无敌斩」收割敌阵。
